I think you have to be careful but presumably AI services offered by PLC or=
 Lexis ought to be more reliable than just general AI searches like ChatGPT=
.  If I use something, I always also ask it to provide the source of the in=
formation so that I can go and check it myself.  Usually, though, I just us=
e them to say draft a paragraph so I know whether it is correct or not but =
it just saves me the time of having to draft something.



